# Exchange Rates

Valid exchange rate frontmatter with the `FROM_TO` key format.

## Basic conversion

price = 100 USD
price_in_euros = price in EUR

## Dollar symbol conversion

total = $200 in EUR

## Currencies without special symbols

yuan_amount = 1000 CNY
rupee_amount = yuan_amount in INR

korean_amount = 5000 INR in KRW

## Global variable with conversion

budget_gbp = budget in GBP

## Chained rates

yen_price = 1000 GBP in JPY

## Inline exchange rate assignment and redefinition

@exchange.USD_GBP = 0.79
salary = 3000 USD
salary_gbp = salary in GBP

@exchange.USD_GBP = 0.72
same_salary_new_rate = salary in GBP

## Same currency is a no-op

unchanged = 100 USD in USD
